+# NaturoPath: 101 Important Legal & Medical Disclaimer
+
+## General Information Only
+
+**NaturoPath: 101** (the "App") is designed for **informational and educational purposes only**. The content provided in this App, including but not limited to text, graphics, images, plant descriptions, phytochemical information, preparation methods, dosage suggestions, and any other material, **does not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment**.
+
+## Not a Substitute for Professional Medical Care
+
+The information in this App **is not intended to replace consultation with a qualified healthcare provider**. Always seek the advice of your physician, pharmacist, herbalist, or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding:
+
+- A medical condition
+- Current medications or supplements
+- Potential herb-drug interactions
+- Starting, stopping, or changing any treatment or medication regimen
+
+**Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you have read in this App.**
+
+## Emergency Situations
+
+If you are experiencing a medical emergency, **call emergency services immediately** (911 in the United States, or your local emergency number). Do not rely on this App for guidance during medical emergencies.
+
+The App includes "red flag" warnings on condition pages to help users identify symptoms that require immediate medical attention. These warnings are not exhaustive, and users should use their judgment and seek medical care whenever concerned about their health.
+
+## No Healthcare Provider Relationship
+
+Use of this App does not create a healthcare provider-patient relationship between you and:
+- The App developers
+- Content contributors
+- Advisory board members
+- Any affiliated individuals or organizations
+
+The App and its content providers are not responsible for any decisions you make based on information provided in the App.
+
+## Herbal Medicine Considerations
+
+### Individual Variation
+Herbal medicines can affect individuals differently based on:
+- Age, weight, and overall health status
+- Genetic factors affecting metabolism
+- Current medications and supplements
+- Pre-existing medical conditions
+- Pregnancy or breastfeeding status
+- Allergies and sensitivities
+
+### Quality and Sourcing
+The efficacy and safety of herbal products depend on:
+- Plant species identification
+- Growing and harvesting conditions
+- Processing and storage methods
+- Presence of adulterants or contaminants
+- Standardization of active compounds
+
+The App does not endorse any specific herbal product manufacturer or supplier. Users are responsible for ensuring the quality and authenticity of any herbal products they purchase.
+
+### Regulation Status
+**Important**: In many countries, including the United States, herbal supplements are not evaluated by regulatory agencies (such as the FDA) in the same way as pharmaceutical drugs. Claims made about herbal products have not been evaluated by the FDA, and these products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
+
+## Drug-Herb Interactions
+
+The Medicine Cabinet feature of this App provides information about potential interactions between conventional medications and herbal remedies. However:
+
+- The interaction database is **not comprehensive** and may not include all possible interactions
+- Interaction severity ratings are **guidelines only** and individual responses may vary
+- New interactions are continually being discovered through research
+- **Always consult your healthcare provider or pharmacist** before combining herbs with prescription or over-the-counter medications
+
+## Contraindications and Safety Warnings
+
+Each plant and condition page includes contraindication information based on available evidence. However:
+
+- Safety data for many herbs is **incomplete**, especially regarding:
+  - Long-term use
+  - Use during pregnancy and lactation
+  - Use in children
+  - Use in individuals with specific medical conditions
+- Absence of a listed contraindication **does not guarantee safety**
+- If you have any medical condition or take any medications, **consult a healthcare provider** before using herbal remedies
+
+## Evidence Levels
+
+Content in this App is tagged with evidence levels (traditional use, in vitro, animal studies, human trials, strong clinical evidence) to help users understand the research basis for each remedy. However:
+
+- **"Traditional use"** indicates historical use but may lack modern scientific validation
+- Studies may have **limitations** in design, sample size, or quality
+- Research is **ongoing**, and new evidence may change recommendations
+- Evidence level **does not guarantee effectiveness or safety** for any individual
+
+## Content Accuracy and Updates
+
+While we strive to provide accurate, up-to-date information based on current research and traditional knowledge:
+
+- Information may become **outdated** as new research emerges
+- Errors or omissions may occur despite careful review
+- Content is reviewed by our advisory board, but individual entries may be updated at different times
+- Users should verify critical information through additional sources and consult healthcare professionals
+
+## User Responsibility
+
+By using this App, you acknowledge and agree that:
+
+1. You are responsible for your own health decisions
+2. You will consult qualified healthcare providers before:
+   - Starting any herbal remedy
+   - Combining herbs with medications
+   - Stopping or changing prescribed treatments
+   - Using herbs if you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or treating a child
+3. You will inform all your healthcare providers about any herbs or supplements you use
+4. You understand the limitations and intended use of this App
+
+## Limitation of Liability
+
+To the fullest extent permitted by law, the developers, content creators, advisory board members, and all associated parties of NaturoPath: 101 **shall not be liable** for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from:
+
+- Use or inability to use the App
+- Reliance on information provided in the App
+- Errors or omissions in the content
+- Any health outcomes resulting from use of information in the App
+
+## Regulatory Compliance
+
+This App complies with applicable laws and regulations regarding health information applications. However:
+
+- Laws vary by jurisdiction
+- Users are responsible for ensuring their use of the App complies with local laws
+- The App is not intended for use where prohibited by law
+
+## Changes to This Disclaimer
+
+This disclaimer may be updated periodically. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated disclaimer. Users are encouraged to review this disclaimer regularly.
+
+## Contact Information
+
+For questions about this disclaimer or the App's content, please contact:
+
+[Contact information to be added]
+
+---
+
